            <li>Consignment is heavier commercial cargo.</li>
            <li>You can arrange pickup and delivery yourself.</li>
            <li>The ÷6000 divisor protects bulky-but-dense cargo.</li>
            <li>The lower per-kg rate matters at scale.</li>
