      <p>
        The per-kg rate is only the first line of the landed cost. Surcharges, terminal handling,
        airport storage, clearance and SABER all sit on top — and only duty and VAT are verified in
        the snapshot. Everything else is marked LOW with a request-for-quote note.
      </p>

